description: |-
  Assigns one or more existing timeline records to a named timeline in a Cortex case.
  If the named timeline does not exist, it will be created automatically.
  Existing timeline assignments on the records are preserved. Records are appended to the specified timelines.
  To avoid creating unintended timelines, verify the timeline name exists before using this action.
